  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Rose gold PVD 316L stainless steel case with a white (synthetic) leather strap. Fixed rose gold PVD bezel. White dial with rose gold-tone hands and index hour markers. Arabic numerals mark the 3, 6 and 9 o'clock positions. Dial Type: Analog. Powermatic 80.111 automatic movement, containing 23 Jewels, bitting at 28800 vph, and has a power reserve of approximately 80 hours. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Pull / push crown. Transparent case back. Round case shape. Case size: 35 mm. Case thickness: 9.75 mm. Band width: 17 mm. Butterfly clasp. Water resistant at 30 meters / 100 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second. Additional Info: original box, manual (complete accessories). Luxury watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot Lady Heart Automatic White Dial Ladies Watch T050.207.37.017.05.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Lady Heart</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T050.207.37.017.05</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Women's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6p